+/*
+    DashOS (F1h, docs/PPC_LOOP.md): the string instructions.
+
+    lswi/stswi: the byte count is in the instruction, so the code is unrolled like lmw/stmw: a word per register,
+    from rD on and wrapping from r31 to r0; the last register takes the 1-3 bytes left, left-justified, with the
+    low bytes cleared (lswi). EA = (rA|0), with no displacement.
